{"games":[{"id":712717349,"name":"[EASTER🐰] Obby King Remastered","desc":"Obby King is a fast-paced obstacle course game built for players who enjoy competitive challenges and exciting gameplay. Race through 100+ unique obbies, beat the clock, and compete against other players in a single continuous tournament experience.\n\nThere are rounds. Whether you’re new to Obby King or an experienced obby player, the game is easy to pick up and challenging to master.\n\nStay focused. Move fast. Claim the crown.\n\nFeatures\n- Round-style gameplay - compete from start to finish\n- Time-based challenges - speed and accuracy matter\n- Progress-based competition - keep up to stay in the action\n- 100+ obby maps with increasing difficulty\n- Earn coins and customise your character\n- Leaderboards - track progress and show your skills\n\nInvite your friends, enter the tournament, and see who rises to the top.","path":"/game/712717349-obby-king-remastered","slug":"712717349-obby-king-remastered","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/aca450f9cedff43fd4ace77723f3316b286655c35e7b85893a5c2f92a5dcec62.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0144636a68ff59332c41d79b135bc635/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":6,"visitor":59757001,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-04-30T19:48:28.849Z","creator":{"name":"Obby King Community","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":270499015,"name":"[CHRISTMAS] Sandhurst Military Academy Roleplay","desc":"Welcome to the original British Military Academy!\n\n❤️ Please drop a like 👍 and favorite ⭐ our game!\n🏗️ Don't forget to follow for more updates on our game!\n\n💂‍♂️ JOIN THE BRITISH ARMY TO BECOME PART OF THE BEST!\nhttps://www.roblox.com/groups/2621202/BritishArmy\n\n𝐈𝐧𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐦𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧:\nThe British Army Sandhurst Military Academy is where we train our soldiers to fit our motto \"Be The Best.\" This military base has graduated many of the best in combat, investigations, espionage, special operat